This is the patches-ul directory (lineage source changes for 19.1 port).

Layout: one subdirectory per repo (path relative to the tree root),
numbered .patch files inside (git format-patch format, apply from the repo root).

Usage:

    cd WORKING_DIR
    sh device/xiaomi/mocha/patches-ul/install.sh     # apply all patches
    sh device/xiaomi/mocha/patches-ul/uninstall.sh   # revert all patches
    sh device/xiaomi/mocha/patches-ul/check.sh       # verify only (no apply)

NOTE: uninstall.sh reverts via `git checkout -- . && git clean -df` in
each listed repo (destructive: also removes untracked files). Back it up
before running.

Patches:

  system/bt/                      BT RT scheduling FATAL->WARNING,
                                  LDAC codec unavailable
  system/libhidl/                 VINTF race log removal
  frameworks/base/                biometric PromptInfo fix, MmsService
                                  callingUser, SystemUI NPE guard,
                                  ColorFade off, power Notifier NPE,
                                  TelephonyPermissions isShell
  external/dng_sdk/               Android.bp sdk_version removal
  packages/apps/Trebuchet/        Quickstep setupImageDecoder removal

All patches above are committed in their respective repos (local
commits on top of upstream); the .patch files here are the persistent
record and the means to re-apply on a fresh tree.

NOTE: changes to this repo itself (device/xiaomi/mocha, e.g.
system_prop.mk, BoardConfig.mk) are normal commits, not patches,
and are pushed to the device repo remote directly.
